 a handmade ceramic fruit bowl holding a small natural assortment of fresh fruit; no product labels or printed packaging.\",\"bbox\":[-16,-208,416,272]},{\"label\":\"object\",\"caption\":\"A bright contemporary living room visible beyond the kitchen on the right, with restrained neutral furnishings, a sunlit window and clean domestic details, softly receding in depth without drawing attention away from the refrigerator note.\",\"bbox\":[-416,128,416,736]},{\"label\":\"object\",\"caption\":\"A small cream-colored square sticky note attached flat to the upper-middle area of the refrigerator door, with tactile matte paper, slightly imperfect edges, a faint curled corner and a soft contact shadow. The note is large enough in frame for its writing to remain clearly legible.\",\"bbox\":[-208,-544,48,-272]},{\"label\":\"text\",\"caption\":\"Exactly three neat lines of dark charcoal handwritten Simplified Chinese on the cream sticky note, natural felt-tip pen strokes, high contrast, evenly spaced and fully readable. Preserve every character and punctuation mark exactly; no heading, signature or extra marks.\",\"text\":\"记得买牛奶和鸡蛋！\\n牛奶两盒，鸡蛋一打。\\n顺便带一袋面包。\",\"bbox\":[-180,-522,20,-290]}],\"bbox_coord_space\":\"abs_centralized\",\"bbox_format\":\"yxyx\"}"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 54, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.40.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [65], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [304.2271728515625, 113.92044067382812], "pos": [-514.8505249023438, -107.6524658203125], "widgets_values": ["lora_latest.safet